{
  "page": 565,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5287,
      "text": "Kelak dia akan Kami beri tanda pada belalai(nya).846)",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5288,
      "text": "Sungguh, Kami telah menguji mereka (orang musyrik Mekkah) sebagaimana Kami telah menguji pemilik-pemilik kebun, ketika mereka bersumpah pasti akan memetik (hasil)nya pada pagi hari,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5289,
      "text": "tetapi mereka tidak mengecualikan (dengan mengucapkan, \"Insya Allah\").",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5290,
      "text": "Lalu kebun itu ditimpa bencana (yang datang) dari Tuhanmu ketika mereka sedang tidur.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5291,
      "text": "Maka jadilah kebun itu hitam seperti malam yang gelap gulita,847)",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5292,
      "text": "lalu pada pagi hari mereka saling memanggil.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5293,
      "text": "\"Pergilah pagi-pagi ke kebunmu jika kamu hendak memetik hasil.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5294,
      "text": "Maka mereka pun berangkat sambil berbisik-bisik.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5295,
      "text": "\"Pada hari ini jangan sampai ada orang miskin masuk ke dalam kebunmu.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5296,
      "text": "Dan berangkatlah mereka di pagi hari dengan niat menghalangi (orang-orang miskin) padahal mereka mampu (menolongnya).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5297,
      "text": "Maka ketika mereka melihat kebun itu, mereka berkata, \"Sungguh, kita ini benar-benar orang-orang yang sesat,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5298,
      "text": "bahkan kita tak memperoleh apa pun.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5299,
      "text": "Berkatalah seorang yang paling bijak di antara mereka, \"Bukankah aku telah mengatakan kepadamu, mengapa kamu tidak bertasbih (kepada Tuhanmu).\"848)",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5300,
      "text": "Mereka mengucapkan, \"Mahasuci Tuhan kami, sungguh, kami adalah orang-orang yang zalim.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5301,
      "text": "Lalu mereka saling berhadapan dan saling menyalahkan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5302,
      "text": "Mereka berkata, \"Celaka kita! Sesungguhnya kita orang-orang yang melampaui batas.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5303,
      "text": "Mudah-mudahan Tuhan memberikan ganti kepada kita dengan (kebun) yang lebih baik daripada yang ini, sungguh, kita mengharapkan ampunan dari Tuhan kita.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5304,
      "text": "Seperti itulah azab (di dunia). Dan sungguh, azab akhirat lebih besar sekiranya mereka mengetahui.849)",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5305,
      "text": "Sungguh, bagi orang-orang yang bertakwa (disediakan) surga yang penuh kenikmatan di sisi Tuhannya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5306,
      "text": "Apakah patut Kami memperlakukan orang-orang Islam itu seperti orang-orang yang berdosa (orang kafir)?850)",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5307,
      "text": "Mengapa kamu (berbuat demikian)? Bagaimana kamu mengambil keputusan?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5308,
      "text": "Atau apakah kamu mempunyai kitab (yang diturunkan Allah) yang kamu pelajari?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5309,
      "text": "Sesungguhnya kamu dapat memilih apa saja yang ada di dalamnya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5310,
      "text": "Atau apakah kamu memperoleh (janji-janji yang diperkuat dengan) sumpah dari Kami, yang tetap berlaku sampai hari Kiamat; bahwa kamu dapat mengambil keputusan (sekehendakmu)?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5311,
      "text": "Tanyakanlah kepada mereka, \"Siapakah di antara mereka yang bertanggung jawab terhadap (keputusan yang diambil itu)?\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5312,
      "text": "Atau apakah mereka mempunyai sekutu-sekutu? Kalau begitu hendaklah mereka mendatangkan sekutu-sekutunya jika mereka orang-orang yang benar.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 41,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5313,
      "text": "(Ingatlah) pada hari ketika betis disingkapkan851) dan mereka diseru untuk bersujud; maka mereka tidak mampu,852)",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 42,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
  "language": "id"
}
